Upstream Attribution
--------------------

This project initially branched from "Alyn SA-MP Mobile" (v17.x), whose
source code was released publicly and for free by its author:

    https://github.com/Fiki-io/Alyn-Samp-Mobile

Original authorship notices ("Created by ALYN ..." file headers) are
preserved on purpose. Extensive bug fixes, arm64/Android 14+ adaptations,
rendering/input/networking overhauls, launcher redesign, and tooling were
developed independently in this repository.

Proprietary Game Content (Excluded from This Repository)
--------------------------------------------------------

This repository does NOT distribute proprietary Rockstar Games binaries,
game data, or commercial fonts:

  * GTA: San Andreas native binaries (libGTASA.so, libImmEmulatorJ.so),
    GTA:SA APK assets (assets/data, assets/Text, assets/Fonts, etc.), and
    game data files belong to Rockstar Games / Take-Two Interactive and
    must be supplied locally by the user from their own legally owned
    GTA: San Andreas Android v2.10 copy (see tools/engine/prepare_gtasa.py).
  * Commercial UI fonts (Gotham, Museo Sans, Helvetica Neue, etc.) have
    been removed and replaced with open-source fonts (Roboto, Apache-2.0;
    Montserrat via Google Fonts, OFL-1.1).

